//< Out of range on a slice held in a struct
//<
//< **Report the place of use.** The code generator embeds the position for the built-in slice; the
//< struct version's `Index_ref.at_ref` takes the caller's position as a default argument ("Default
//< arguments" in `docs/SPEC-language.md`) and `std/lang`'s bounds_panic writes the message.
// EXPECT: panic: index out of bounds in Slice.at_ref (idx: 9, len: 2)
